      "layout": "A static diorama about 4 m across. The island is a round turf disc of radius about 2.0 with its top at y=1.6. Beneath it hangs an inverted cone of faceted rock tapering to a point at y=0, which is the lowest point and rests on the floor; the model is displayed as a floating-looking prop with its tip at the floor. Ruins sit at the back (-Z) and centre: a broken arch, standing pillars and a stepped stone platform with a glowing teal rune. The waterfall pours from a spring pool on the left (+X) edge at z=0.3, falls past the rock underside as a ribbon of pale blue slabs, and ends in a mist of small spheres and glowing droplets below the rim. Trees are in two clusters: a large round-canopy tree at the front right (-X, +Z) and two small trees at the back left. Genshin style means clean pastel flat colours with a warm top light and cool underside, thin dark outline-like trim parts, glowing cyan and gold accents, and chunky simplified shapes with small flower and crystal details.",
